@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@apiToken = local-api-token
@callbackToken = local-callback-token

### Change batch_no on every run, or expect 409.
# @name create
POST {{baseUrl}}/batches
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"batch_no":"demo-manual-001","documents":[{"document_no":"DOC-1","payload":{"mode":"manual"}}]}

### Submit, keep PROCESSING until manual callback
POST {{baseUrl}}/batches/demo-manual-001/process
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}

### Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/batches/demo-manual-001
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}

### Read id and current attempt_count
GET {{baseUrl}}/batches/demo-manual-001/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}

### Replace document_id with ID from create/list response
POST {{baseUrl}}/callbacks
Authorization: Bearer {{callbackToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"callback_id":"manual-event-001","document_id":"REPLACE_WITH_ID","attempt_count":1,"status":"SUCCESS"}

### Read next_retry_at in ListDocuments; wait until due. Early retry returns retried=0.
### Retry only queues eligible FAILED, does not submit
POST {{baseUrl}}/batches/demo-manual-001/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
